<title>AUSTRIA: TENNIS-ST.POELTEN GRAND PRIX FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ST.POELTEN GRAND PRIX FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ST. POELTEN, Austria 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in the $425,000 St. Poelten Grand Prix men's tennis tournament on Tuesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Gilbert Schaller (Austria) beat 8-Thomas Johansson (Sweden) 4-6 7-6 (7-3) 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>Jan Kroslak (Slovakia) beat Adrian Voinea (Romania) 6-0 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>Karim Alami (Morocco) beat Patrick Baur (Germany) 6-4  5-7 7-5</p>
<p>3-Marcelo Rios (Chile) beat Andrea Gaudenzi (Italy) 6-4 4-6 6-4</p>
<p>5-Marc Rosset (Switzerland) beat Sargis Sargsian (Armenia) 6-2 4-6 7-6 (7-2).</p>
<p>Dominik Hrbaty (Slovakia) beat 2-Yevgeny Kafelnikov 6-3 6-3  </p>
<p>Hernan Gumy (Argentina) beat Arnaud Boetsch (France) 7-6 (7-2)</p>
<p>7-6 (7-4)</p>
</text>
